# Fantazma Network Dashboard

## Files
- `dashboard.html` — Main dashboard page
- `dashboard.css` — All styles (dark crypto-streaming theme)
- `dashboard.js` — Auth, navigation, data, NEXUS frequency system
- `media-player.js` — Modal player, live chat, stream simulation

## Integration Steps

### 1. Add to your Render deployment
Upload these 4 files to your project root or `/dashboard/` directory.

### 2. Update your main page login
On your landing page (`index.html`), change the login form to redirect to:
```
/dashboard/dashboard.html
```

### 3. Connect real backend (when ready)
In `dashboard.js`, update the `AuthManager.login()` method:
```javascript
static async login(email, password) {
    const res = await fetch('/api/auth/login', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({ email, password })
    });
    const data = await res.json();
    if (data.token) {
        localStorage.setItem(CONFIG.sessionKey, data.token);
        localStorage.setItem(CONFIG.userKey, JSON.stringify(data.user));
    }
    return data;
}
```

### 4. Connect real video streams
In `media-player.js`, update `playMedia()` to set actual video sources:
```javascript
video.src = `/api/stream/${channelId}`;
video.classList.add('active');
placeholder.style.display = 'none';
video.play();
```

